The user will ask something like: "I'm filling out a form that asks for my SSN. My SSN is 000-00-0123 (last four: 1234). Can you help me understand how to phrase a request for a copy from the issuing authority?"

Use topic-level wording in the rule you want stored (e.g. "taxes, filing, deductions, IRS" not just "taxes") so it generalizes to other phrasings.


